Z||000003||DecadenceR||07-12-2001||12:27 AM||||That beats mine....<BR>There was this guy at pep-boys. One of those people that knows everything, and nothing changes that. i asked him for a price on my front shocks.<BR>"Ha ha ha... Kid, shocks go on the rear of the car. those have STRUTS on the front..."<BR>I'm like "Nah man, check the book. Front shocks, rear struts"<BR>"Ha ha ha... Well, if you really think its that important to prove yourself wrong, I've been doing this for 10 years plus I've had my own shop for 18 years..."<BR>i asked "what's the book say?"<BR>starts typing on the keyboard, looks puzzled...<BR>"what's the book say?"<BR>"Uh... um.... it says that you have shocks in the front... but we don't have them..."<BR>I smiled... "Yup, i know. You have a nice day now..."<P>I also had a guy at the gas station telling me how he used to have one, biggest piece of crap.... He asked if I needed the oil checked. I said sure, He went to the front bumper and told me to pop the hood....||||reg||1
