Z||000011||Mach10||07-12-2001||02:47 AM||||Comments made to me about my car:<BR>"Oh Lord... The Disposible Car."<BR>"Huh, well, whatever makes you happy, man. I'll still be here, adding another wing to my house, if--no--when it breaks down. Do yourself a favor, and never go into the used car business."<BR>"Huh-huh-huh. They catch fire. Huh-huh-huh" -NOT joking!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>"Don't the GT's of those come with v8s?<BR>"What a piece, even this POS would trash your wimpy 4 cylinder firebox." -At the lights, just before a 6-car length humiliation. Hey, he squealed the tires first  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>"Oh, God. You actually bought it."||||reg||6
