Z||000013||Fiero_24||07-12-2001||08:03 AM||||I was in line at autozone and some customer looked at my GT with the vette lamps on the rear and said "Look some idiot tried turning a piece of Sh*t Fiero into a Ferrari", I turned and said, "Yea, but I made your dumb A$$ look twice".  The fool was driving an 87 Escort, and he calls mine a piece of Sh*t.  Oh well, gotta love the idiots in this world.  <P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||1
Z||000014||Denny||07-12-2001||08:19 AM||||The local Advance people roll their eyes when I say "Pontiac Fiero."<P>American Speed Center people ignore me.<P>I get the best service from a local performance machine shop, and from Pep Boys.<P>When I need a part from the local dealers I look up the PN first, then give them that when I call or stop. Otherwise they say, "Sorry, we don't carry Fiero parts anymore."<P>I learned to deal with it.||||reg||7
