Z||000031||dlancer407||07-12-2001||07:49 PM||||Having just recently bought my first Fiero I have not heard any negative comments yet,but judgeing from all the above posts I guess it's just a matter of time.Which will make it worse for me than the rest of you folks. I say that because for the last 18 years I have been hearing the same load of crap about my other car. I own a 1973 AMC Javelin AMX that I have restored. So if you think you have heard it all about Fiero's think of all the S--t I have heard not just about my AMX, but throw in all the crap about The Gremlin, The Pacer, The Hornet. Lets just say I've heard it all. It just reinforces my theory. 80% of the people in this world are ( IDIOTS ) and it's up to the rest of us to keep this world running smoothly. I say drive what you like.||||reg||6
