Z||000060||GTMike||07-18-2001||01:52 AM||||ok i got one.  last weekend my friend and i were driving in down town denver trying to find a freaking parking lot....  anyways.  some drunk guys  yells out thats not a ferrari thats a ferarro.   well we  had a good laugh.  so we ended  up haveing to do valy parking.   so we pull up and the guy roles his eyes and gets in and trys to find the e break.... i showed him.  and watch him drive away.<P>later that night went to go pick it up and there were 3 guys  waiting to go get cars. and the guy that  took mine earlyer  gets up and jumps infront to the other to guys and says i got this one  with a big smile on his face.    after he comes  back with the car. and hands me the keys   he says   i realy like your car...  <P>we now call my car the ferarrow.   lol      <P>||||reg||1
